<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>This function resets the reaction of the specified object, returning it to whatever base group hostility it should be at. This function is normally used in conjunction with <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/SetReactionOverride" title="SetReactionOverride">SetReactionOverride</a>() to return an object to their group's hostility.
</p><p><br />
</p>
